WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.614 --> 00:00:03.197
(mellow music)

00:00:09.264 --> 00:00:10.458
- I've heard a lot about this idea

00:00:10.458 --> 00:00:13.712
that peanut butter can
act as a cheap replacement

00:00:13.712 --> 00:00:15.940
for moisturizing shaving cream.

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:18.240
- Today, we're shaving with peanut butter.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.685
- There are a bunch of YouTube videos

00:00:19.685 --> 00:00:22.044
spanning many years of this thing,

00:00:22.044 --> 00:00:23.418
and they're like, it's
a hack, it's a hack.

00:00:23.418 --> 00:00:24.669
- I love peanut butter.

00:00:24.669 --> 00:00:26.752
(laughs)

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:30.475
- It feels really good
on my skin, I must admit.

00:00:30.475 --> 00:00:33.135
- Uh, do what I usually do when I shave.

00:00:33.135 --> 00:00:35.411
Oh, oh, okay, hmm.

00:00:35.411 --> 00:00:37.380
- This, oh wow, I don't know.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:39.323
- [Woman In Dark Denim
Shirt] I mean, it's working.

00:00:39.323 --> 00:00:41.135
- Oh, I put way too much on.

00:00:41.135 --> 00:00:42.957
- Immediate thoughts was, oh, it's smooth,

00:00:42.957 --> 00:00:44.315
oh, it's getting stuck, oh, now it's

00:00:44.315 --> 00:00:45.684
not really doing anything.

00:00:45.684 --> 00:00:48.329
- Maybe you need less peanut
butter than what I have on.

00:00:48.329 --> 00:00:50.514
- I used way too much,
so I'm putting the slack

00:00:50.514 --> 00:00:53.045
to moisturize this bottom leg.

00:00:53.045 --> 00:00:54.054
- Look at it.

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:55.409
Can you see that?

00:00:55.409 --> 00:00:56.700
There's just lumps of peanut butter,

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:58.792
like spilling out of the razor.

00:00:58.792 --> 00:00:59.897
It looks foul.

00:00:59.897 --> 00:01:01.641
- It's a bit thick, and it's kind of

00:01:01.641 --> 00:01:03.717
going into my razor right now, so.

00:01:03.717 --> 00:01:07.394
- I mean, it feels like it's
dragging, but it is working.

00:01:07.394 --> 00:01:08.820
- I mean, that feels pretty smooth.

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:09.878
(laughs)

00:01:09.878 --> 00:01:11.408
I'm like, what?

00:01:11.408 --> 00:01:13.084
- [Woman In Light Denim
Shirt] Oh, yeah, it's smooth.

00:01:13.084 --> 00:01:14.046
I'm gonna keep going.

00:01:14.046 --> 00:01:15.409
- The problem is that we have too much.

00:01:15.409 --> 00:01:17.022
- A little bit goes a long way with this.

00:01:17.022 --> 00:01:19.045
- So, my theory is that
you're using the peanut butter

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:21.192
to kind of grease your arm, so that

00:01:21.192 --> 00:01:24.258
it's just like an oily sheen.

00:01:24.258 --> 00:01:25.756
That's quite lovely.

00:01:25.756 --> 00:01:28.065
- The only thing I would
say is a down point,

00:01:28.065 --> 00:01:29.634
I can't stop touching my leg.

00:01:29.634 --> 00:01:31.088
Like, it's really nice.

00:01:31.088 --> 00:01:34.232
- What money you would save
not getting shaving cream,

00:01:34.232 --> 00:01:36.248
you would end up spending on razors.

00:01:36.248 --> 00:01:38.581
So, I think it just
depends on what you want.

00:01:38.581 --> 00:01:40.295
- Cream is two bucks more,
and I'd rather just get that

00:01:40.295 --> 00:01:42.740
and not clog my sink.

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:44.925
- That being said, like,
this feels really nice.

00:01:44.925 --> 00:01:47.331
- It's like more silky
than I use shave gel,

00:01:47.331 --> 00:01:48.675
because I fell like it's moisturized me

00:01:48.675 --> 00:01:51.111
more than shave gel does, which is insane.

00:01:51.111 --> 00:01:52.815
- But, super messy and gross.

00:01:52.815 --> 00:01:55.398
(upbeat music)

